# Agent Level Evaluator

This repository provides a self-evaluation framework for AI agents. 

## Usage

1. Read `FRAMEWORK.md` for Level 1-9 definitions (restaurant metaphor).
2. Read `AGENTS.md` for the evaluation protocol.
3. Follow the 6-axis self-assessment.
4. Run `python3 scripts/evaluate.py` for an interactive evaluation.

The user will ask you to evaluate yourself. Follow the AGENTS.md protocol.
